WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:07.830
Edit a store's listing, feature it, add an event, and see who subscribed for news.

2
00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:13.990
Website keeps the public site up to date: the store directory, events and promotions.

3
00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:17.580
Open a store.

4
00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:24.690
Its listing is in English and Arabic: the name, a tagline, the description and the category.

5
00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.490
Add the opening hours.

6
00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:35.530
Tick Feature to put it at the top of the directory.

7
00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:40.110
Save. The website shows the change at once.

8
00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:46.500
Here is its public address, and the switch to hide or publish the listing.

9
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.130
Events work the same way.

10
00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:55.020
Give the new event a title and a date.

11
00:00:55.020 --> 00:01:03.230
Create it, then add the details in both languages, the times and a cover picture, and publish.

12
00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:10.350
Subscribers lists everyone who signed up for news on the website. Export the list for your newsletter.
